text = "HOW TO PLAY

  Move with  W A S D  or  Arrow Keys
  Drive to the RESTAURANT in the middle to get an order
  Drive to the customer's house to deliver it
  Play the Sushi Slice mini-game to earn bonus points!

SLICING:
  • Click and drag your mouse across flying sushi to slice them
  • Slice several in one swipe for a COMBO bonus!
  • AVOID   Wasabi Bombs    Expired Fish    Hot Peppers
  • You have 3 lives and 30 seconds — good luck!"
